    {
      "id": "t1",
      "vo": "In a 1971 study, a stranger posing as a fellow volunteer brought people a free Coke, then asked them to buy his raffle tickets. They bought about twice as many as people who got nothing.",
      "emph": [
        "free",
        "twice"
      ],
      "replace": {
